wallpapers/*.jpg
wallpapers/*.jpeg
wallpapers/*.png
wallpapers/*.bmp
!wallpapers/README.md

# Binarios auxiliares regeneraveis a partir do codigo (.cs)
app/GerarIcone.exe

# Temporarios do build
*.pdb
obj/
